    "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN OUR DISCORD</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong>KAOS SurVival</strong> is a survival game in an open world, where the player can explore and find items that will make his life easier.<br>  The player can build a shelter or a large fortress to keep his possessions and defend himself from other players.<br>  The player can create clan or create his group of friends, send messages within the game.<br>  The <strong>kaos</strong> has a system of destroying bases using C4 explosives, the player can obtain through loot the goods of another player.<br>  Inventory and crafting system available.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>KAOS SurVival</strong> is a survival game in an open world, where the player can explore and find items that will make his life easier.<br>  The player can build a shelter or a large fortress to keep his possessions and defend himself from other players.<br>  The player can create clan or create his group of friends, send messages within the game.<br>  The <strong>kaos</strong> has a system of destroying bases using C4 explosives, the player can obtain through loot the goods of another player.<br>  Inventory and crafting system available.",
    "short_description": "Get ready for chaos in KAOS SurVival! Explore an open world, gather resources, and build shelters to survive. Form clans, raid other players, and craft essential items. In a world where everything can be destroyed, only the strongest will reign. Prove your strength and dominate the chaos!",
